<template>
	<DocsPage
		locale="en"
		title="Theming and customization"
		description="One source of design: --ui-* tokens for color, size and shape, which you can connect to your brand."
	>
		<h2 id="appearance">Appearance engine</h2>
		<p>
			Each component chooses its look with the <code>variant</code> (the treatment) and <code>color</code> (the semantic color) props, plus <code>size</code>, <code>radius</code> and <code>elevation</code> where they apply: <code>UIButton</code>, <code>UICard</code>, <code>UIBadge</code>, <code>UIInput</code>, <code>UIAvatar</code>, <code>UIAlert</code> and <code>UIToast</code>, among others. Their recipes (<code>buttonTheme</code>, <code>badgeTheme</code>, <code>inputTheme</code>…) are exported from <code>@meekojs/ui/theme</code>. To make your own, import <code>appearance()</code> from there and spread its result into <code>defineTheme()</code>.
		</p>
		<AppearanceVariants />
		<AppearancePlayground english />

		<h2 id="theme">Light, dark and system</h2>
		<p>
			<code>theme</code>
			belongs to the framework. It stores the preference and applies
			<code>data-theme</code>
			before the first paint.
			<MeekoLink to="/theme-toggle">UIThemeToggle</MeekoLink>
			lets readers change it, also without JavaScript. Tokens change by themselves: do not write rules per theme.
		</p>
		<h2 id="palette">The palette</h2>
		<p>Each scale has 12 steps: 1 and 2 for backgrounds, 3 to 5 for controls, 6 to 8 for borders, 9 and 10 for solids, 11 and 12 for text. The background is pure white in light and pure black in dark. Violet is for the main action, the focus, the selection and what is active: if everything is violet, nothing stands out.</p>
		<h3 id="scale-primary"><code>--ui-color-primary-*</code></h3>
		<div
			class="docs-scale"
			role="img"
			aria-label="Primary scale, from step 1 to 12"
		>
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-1)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-2)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-3)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-4)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-5)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-6)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-7)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-8)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-9)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-10)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-11)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-primary-12)" />
		</div>
		<h3 id="scale-surface"><code>--ui-color-surface-*</code></h3>
		<div
			class="docs-scale"
			role="img"
			aria-label="Surface scale, from step 1 to 12"
		>
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-1)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-2)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-3)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-4)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-5)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-6)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-7)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-8)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-9)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-10)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-11)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-surface-12)" />
		</div>
		<h3 id="scale-info"><code>--ui-color-info-*</code></h3>
		<div
			class="docs-scale"
			role="img"
			aria-label="Info scale, from step 1 to 12"
		>
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-1)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-2)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-3)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-4)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-5)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-6)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-7)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-8)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-9)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-10)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-11)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-info-12)" />
		</div>
		<h3 id="scale-success"><code>--ui-color-success-*</code></h3>
		<div
			class="docs-scale"
			role="img"
			aria-label="Success scale, from step 1 to 12"
		>
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-success-1)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-success-2)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-success-3)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-success-4)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-success-5)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-success-6)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-success-7)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-success-8)" />
			<span style="background: var(--ui-color-success-9)" />
